  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Active Citizenry Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(West Bank and Gaza):  . .This activity aims to increase Palestinians&apos; civic participation and support their efforts to advocate for positive changes, foster social and political advancement, and improve overall living conditions and prosperity. The activity has three main objectives: enhancing governance and institutional capacity of CSOs; increasing participatory community development and civic participation; and promoting transparency, accountability, and advocacy efforts through strengthening dialogue between civil society and relevant stakeholders...Using FY22 funds, the activity will develop tailored plans to build the capacity of partner CSOs and CBOs. It will continue to award grants to support partner CSOs and CBOs to meet their institutional development plans and implement activities that contribute to the five thematic areas:  human rights and rule of law initiatives, social inclusion, advancing accountability and transparency, water and wastewater management, and promotion of solid waste management practices. Interventions will also strengthen citizens&apos; engagements and participatory community development including outreach and advocacy activities to increase dialogue toward promoting accountability and transparency. Moreover, this activity will identify gender differences and gaps through performing analysis at the national level and identify training and interventions within the activity to target these gaps.  The activity will improve the foundations for good governance where a vibrant civil society and rule of law are essential elements for sustainable development. ..This activity will contribute to the Democracy, Human Rights and Governance (DRG) earmark and will partially contribute to the Women&apos;s Leadership directive.......</narrative>
  </description>
